    <string name="settings_streaming_how_title">How rules are resolved</string>
    <string name="settings_streaming_how_body">1. A profile pinned to the connected Cast device wins.\n2. Otherwise, when casting, the casting default applies.\n3. Otherwise the network rule: mobile data (or metered Wi-Fi) → the mobile profile; Wi-Fi/Ethernet → the Wi-Fi profile.\n4. Otherwise the default profile.\n\nFinally, if adaptive quality is active and the connection is degraded, the cap profile is applied on top — it can only lower quality, never raise it.</string>

